WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.913
As they approached Columbus’ three ships, Vinnie noticed a few sickly men.

2
00:00:06.914 --> 00:00:09.964
They were very thin and pale.

3
00:00:09.965 --> 00:00:14.263
One man had dark spots on his legs.

4
00:00:14.264 --> 00:00:20.435
"Julio," Vinnie whispered. "Those men look very ill."

5
00:00:20.436 --> 00:00:23.350
Julio nodded sadly.

6
00:00:23.351 --> 00:00:26.874
"They have just gotten back from a long journey.

7
00:00:26.875 --> 00:00:29.005
They have scurvy."

8
00:00:29.006 --> 00:00:32.228
"Scurvy?" asked Vinnie.

9
00:00:32.229 --> 00:00:36.823
"It’s a disease some sailors get," said Julio.

10
00:00:36.824 --> 00:00:41.802
"The ship’s doctor thinks it’s because sailors don’t eat enough fruit."

11
00:00:41.803 --> 00:00:47.014
"But fruit is good for you!" exclaimed Mandy.

12
00:00:47.015 --> 00:00:49.785
Julio smiled at her.

13
00:00:49.786 --> 00:00:52.108
"You’re right, Mandy.

14
00:00:52.109 --> 00:00:55.805
But, aboard ship, fruit rots very quickly.

15
00:00:55.806 --> 00:01:00.744
On long voyages, it’s impossible to keep fruit fresh."

16
00:01:00.745 --> 00:01:04.726
Vinnie and Mandy looked at the sick men.

17
00:01:04.727 --> 00:01:08.676
"That’s sad," said Mandy.

18
00:01:08.677 --> 00:01:15.174
Suddenly, a high-pitched whistle blew and the pier buzzed with excitement. "Time

19
00:01:15.175 --> 00:01:18.676
to sail," said Julio. "But

20
00:01:18.677 --> 00:01:22.759
what about the book?" Mandy asked. Julio

21
00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:25.299
looked around. Sailors

22
00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:29.739
were rushing past him and boarding the ships. "Look!"

23
00:01:29.740 --> 00:01:32.653
he shouted. "There’s

24
00:01:32.654 --> 00:01:37.651
Columbus on the Santa Maria . Come on!"

25
00:01:37.652 --> 00:01:42.833
Julio ran onto the ship, and the children followed.

26
00:01:42.834 --> 00:01:46.867
On deck, a man stood by the ship’s rail.

27
00:01:46.868 --> 00:01:50.740
He was holding several sheets of paper.

28
00:01:50.741 --> 00:01:55.419
"Julio, get to your post," ordered the man.

29
00:01:55.420 --> 00:02:00.673
"Diego, these children must see Columbus," said Julio.

30
00:02:00.674 --> 00:02:03.105
"Can you take them to him?"

31
00:02:03.106 --> 00:02:06.794
Diego looked at the children impatiently.

32
00:02:06.795 --> 00:02:10.257
"He has no time for children," he said.

33
00:02:10.258 --> 00:02:13.216
"Go away."

34
00:02:13.217 --> 00:02:16.699
"Please," pleaded Julio.

35
00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:19.769
"It’s important that they see the captain.

36
00:02:19.770 --> 00:02:24.318
This little girl found his book and wants to give it back to him."

37
00:02:24.319 --> 00:02:30.417
"Since you are Martin Alonzo’s nephew, I will do as you ask," said Diego.

38
00:02:30.418 --> 00:02:33.116
"Good-bye, Vinnie and Mandy.

39
00:02:33.117 --> 00:02:37.040
It was nice meeting you," said Julio.

40
00:02:37.041 --> 00:02:41.951
He waved before running off to another part of the ship.

41
00:02:41.952 --> 00:02:46.653
"Thank you, Julio!" cried the children.

42
00:02:46.654 --> 00:02:51.141
"Come on, we’re sailing in a few minutes," said Diego.

43
00:02:51.142 --> 00:02:55.546
He led them past sailors getting the ship ready.

44
00:02:55.547 --> 00:03:01.774
"I can’t believe we’re on the Santa Maria !" gasped

45
00:03:01.775 --> 00:03:04.774
Vinnie. He looked around

46
00:03:04.775 --> 00:03:10.645
excitedly. Mandy noticed some men carrying big sacks to an opening in the

47
00:03:10.646 --> 00:03:14.723
deck. A ladder led down into the cargo

48
00:03:14.724 --> 00:03:19.286
hold. With a loud crash, one of the men dropped a

49
00:03:19.287 --> 00:03:23.713
sack. Potatoes spilled out, all over the deck.

50
00:03:23.714 --> 00:03:30.030
"Watch out!" shouted Diego. "Grab those potatoes!"

51
00:03:30.031 --> 00:03:34.760
Everyone stopped to catch the rolling potatoes.

52
00:03:34.761 --> 00:03:38.924
"I got one!" Mandy shouted.

53
00:03:38.925 --> 00:03:40.473
"I’ll get that one,"

54
00:03:40.474 --> 00:03:47.469
Vinnie called, running after a potato that rolled a long way down the deck.

55
00:03:47.470 --> 00:03:51.654
Soon the potatoes were collected in the sack again.

56
00:03:51.655 --> 00:03:56.356
A young boy stepped forward and tied the sack tight.

57
00:03:56.357 --> 00:04:00.283
Mandy wiped her hands on her skirt.

58
00:04:00.284 --> 00:04:04.522
"That was fun," she said, laughing.

59
00:04:04.523 --> 00:04:06.712
Then she stopped.

60
00:04:06.713 --> 00:04:10.083
"Vinnie! The ship is moving!"

61
00:04:10.084 --> 00:04:15.056
Mandy looked around, but could not see her brother.

62
00:04:15.057 --> 00:04:19.176
Vinnie had disappeared into the crowd of sailors.

63
00:04:19.177 --> 00:04:24.017
The Santa Maria was pulling slowly away from the pier.

64
00:04:24.018 --> 00:04:33.721
"Oh no! What am I going to do?" she said to herself.

